{'symbol': 'HLT', 'date': '2023-04-19 09:00:00', 'title': "INDUSTRY WATCHDOG TIMESHARE COMPLIANCE WINS KEY RULING FROM FEDERAL COURT, LAWSUIT AGAINST HILTON'S DIAMOND RESORTS WILL PROCEED", 'text': "U.S. DISTRICT COURT DENIES ATTEMPT BY RESORT COMPANY TO DISMISS CASE ON SUMMARY JUDGMENT\xa0\xa0 LANDMARK SUIT AGAINST TIMESHARE COMPANY SET FOR JURY TRIAL JANUARY 2024\xa0\xa0 ALISO VIEJO, CALIF. , APRIL 19, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- TIMESHARE COMPLIANCE, THE NATION'S LEADING TIMESHARE EXIT COMPANY AND INDUSTRY WATCHDOG WON A MAJOR VICTORY FOR NEARLY 800 VICTIMIZED TIMESHARE OWNERS AS A U.S. DISTRICT COURT JUDGE RULED A LAWSUIT AGAINST HILTON'S (NYSE: HLT) TIMESHARE GIANT DIAMOND RESORTS WILL GO FORWARD."}